<h2>Why Should You Choose Large-Format Tiles?</h2>
One of the most effective ways to make a small bathroom appear larger is by reducing visual interruptions.

Large-format porcelain or stone-effect tiles create a seamless appearance by minimising grout lines and visual clutter. When the eye isn't constantly stopped by grid lines, the room naturally feels more expansive.

Popular luxury choices include:
<ul>
 	<li>Marble-effect porcelain slabs</li>
 	<li>Travertine-inspired finishes</li>
 	<li>Limestone-look tiles</li>
 	<li>Large-format neutral stone surfaces</li>
</ul>
Using the same flooring and wall material throughout the room can further enhance the sense of continuity and openness. Sourcing premium large slabs is simplified through specialist <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/procurement/">luxury sanitaryware and tile procurement</a>, creating a cohesive five-star hotel atmosphere.
